flowchart TD
    Start([START: Main Flow\nflow: autolaunched\nvariable: validationInput String\nvariable: isValid Boolean])
    Assign[ASSIGNMENT: Prepare Data\nset: validationInput = "demo"\nset: isValid = true]
    Subflow[[SUBFLOW: Validation Subflow\nflow: Validation_Subflow\ninput: request = {!validationInput}]]
    Decision{DECISION: Check Result}
    End1([END: Success])
    End2([END: Failed])

    Start --> Assign
    Assign --> Subflow
    Subflow --> Decision
    Decision -->|Valid if isValid = true| End1
    Decision -->|Invalid default| End2
